{"type":"message","id":"69c66a35","parentId":"f9c14629","timestamp":"2026-06-25T05:29:22.318Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user has sent_DRAIN. This is an automatic feed drain entry - the message starts with \"FEED_DRAIN\" followed by JSON.\n\nAccording to SOUL.md:\n- This is the **Feed drain entry** \n- It's triggered by a cron job from `dispatch_feed_jobs.py`\n- The message format is: `FEED_DRAIN {\"project\": \"coinography\"}`\n- The project is \"coinography\"\n- This is for a single story per cron (one story, then end the turn)\n\nLet me follow the Feed drain entry steps:\n\n1. First, I need to claim ONE job from the feed_jobs queue\n2. Set RUN_MODE=FEED_DRAIN, FEED_JOB_ID, PROJECT_SLUG, SELECTION_FILE, PICKER_MODE=classify-only, STEP25_GATE=OFF, CLASSIFY_ONLY_FLAG=\"--classify-only\", N=1\n\nLet me start by claiming the next feed job.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tooluse_27KrQEtWxvRLmXWNEDff0f","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 - <<PYEOF\nimport json, sqlite3, os\ndb_path = os.path.expanduser(\"~/.openclaw/data/editorial.db\")\nconn = sqlite3.connect(db_path)\nconn.row_factory = sqlite3.Row\n# Claim next available job for coinography\njob = conn.execute(\"\"\"\n    SELECT id, project, feed_id, candidate_index, selection_file\n    FROM feed_jobs\n    WHERE project = 'coinography' AND status = 'queued'\n    ORDER BY created_at ASC\n    LIMIT 1\n\"\"\").fetchone()\nif job:\n    # Mark as claimed\n    conn.execute(\"UPDATE feed_jobs SET status = 'claimed', claimed_at = datetime('now') WHERE id = ?\", (job['id'],))\n    conn.commit()\n    print(json.dumps({\"job_id\": job['id'], \"project\": job['project'], \"feed_id\": job['feed_id'],\n                     \"candidate_index\": job['candidate_index'], \"selection_file\": job['selection_file']}))\nelse:\n    print(\"null\")\nconn.close()\nPYEOF"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"minimax.minimax-m2.5","usage":{"input":23706,"output":441,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24147,"cost":{"input":0.0071118,"output":0.0005292,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.007640999999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1782365352218,"responseId":"3005e57c-f16a-4a35-9d77-f4355e6cadb3"}}
