{"type":"message","id":"e5f55987","parentId":"ad0524b8","timestamp":"2026-06-25T05:39:54.237Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I sent a message to the group about the story being published. The FEED_DRAIN entry is complete - I've:\n\n1. ✅ Claimed a job from feed_jobs (job_id 85)\n2. ✅ Run Step 0 (init)\n3. ✅ Run Step 0.5 (persist N=1)\n4. ✅ Run Step 1 (build picker input with --feed-job-id)\n5. ✅ Run Step 1c (picker classify-only)\n6. ✅ Run Step 2.0 (iteration start)\n7. ✅ Run Step 2.1 (deep research)\n8. ✅ Run Step 2.2 (write article)\n9. ✅ Run Step 2.3 (create image)\n10. ✅ Run Step 2.4 (Google Drive upload)\n11. ✅ Skipped Step 2.5 (per-story gate - STEP25_GATE=OFF for FEED_DRAIN)\n12. ✅ Run Step 2.6 (WordPress publish + card)\n13. ✅ Marked feed job as done\n14. ✅ Dispatched to check for more jobs (DISPATCH_IDLE)\n\nNow I should end the turn silently as per the FEED_DRAIN entry instructions.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tooluse_eBifiOsPd93hozd7h6CYWK","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Final cleanup for the run\nsource /tmp/coinography-run-env.sh\npython3 - <<PYEOF\nimport json, sqlite3, os\nm = json.load(open(os.environ[\"PIPELINE_MANIFEST\"]))\npick_run_id = m[\"batch\"][\"pick_run_id\"]\ndb = os.path.expanduser(\"~/.openclaw/data/editorial.db\")\nconn = sqlite3.connect(db); conn.row_factory = sqlite3.Row\nrows = conn.execute(\"SELECT pick_index, category, primary_headline, status, failed_reason FROM picked_stories WHERE pick_run_id=? ORDER BY pick_index\", (pick_run_id,)).fetchall()\nprint(\"=== Final batch report ===\")\nfor r in rows:\n    print(f\"  {r['pick_index']}. [{r['status']}] {r['category']} - {r['primary_headline'][:80]}\" + (f\"  ({r['failed_reason']})\" if r['failed_reason'] else \"\"))\nconn.close()\nPYEOF"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"minimax.minimax-m2.5","usage":{"input":38994,"output":479,"cacheRead